# Ownership routing for GitHub and future contributors. The solo-maintainer
# ruleset does not require self-approval. Enable required code-owner review when
# a second active maintainer is available.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                           @TheAggressive

# Release and CI machinery. These files decide what ships to every install and
# what the gate actually checks, so they should never be changed casually:
#
#   - bin/ci/contracts.mjs (and its parsing lib) is the only thing keeping local
#     and Actions in agreement; weakening it silently weakens every other check.
#   - bin/release/lib.sh is the allowlist that defines the distributable ZIP.
#   - The release workflow holds the tokens that publish.
/.github/workflows/         @TheAggressive
/.github/rulesets/          @TheAggressive
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @TheAggressive
/.github/dependabot.yml     @TheAggressive
/bin/ci/                    @TheAggressive
/bin/release/               @TheAggressive
/.releaserc.json            @TheAggressive

# Version and dependency floors asserted by bin/ci/contracts.mjs.
/composer.json              @TheAggressive
/composer.lock              @TheAggressive
/package.json               @TheAggressive
/pnpm-lock.yaml             @TheAggressive
/phpstan.neon               @TheAggressive
/style.css                  @TheAggressive
